<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins $1 bln cruise ship order.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins $1 bln cruise ship order.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kvaerner Masa-Yards said on Friday it had signed a $1 billion contract with Royal Caribbean Cruises Ltd to build two new cruise liners.</p>
<p>The ships will be constructed at Kvaerner Masa-Yards Turku shipyard for delivery in 1999 and 2000.</p>
</text>
